{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"08f7facf7c7e5895","x":-480,"y":-2280,"width":413,"height":563,"type":"group","label":"语言和句型、句子文法的关系"},
		{"id":"988639e4e381b737","type":"text","text":"文法\n","x":-414,"y":-124,"width":74,"height":50,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"73f841d82821d1b1","type":"text","text":"比如：G：\u000b\nE→TE'\u000b \nE'→+E|ε\u000b \nT→FT’\nT'→T|ε\nF→PF'\nF'→*F'|ε\nP→(E)|a|b|∧\n- **终结符 (Terminals):** 乐高积木块，不可再分。这里是 `+`, `*`, `(`, `)`, `a`, `b`, `^` (即 $\\wedge$)。\n- **非终结符 (Non-terminals):** 说明书上的“组件名称”。这里是 $E, E', T, T', F, F', P$。\n- $\\varepsilon$ (Epsilon): “什么都不做”或“空\n","x":-680,"y":40,"width":489,"height":380,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"ec7039fb224d0b1e","type":"text","text":"G：\u000bE→TE'\u000b \n这个文法其实是在描述一种算术表达式。比如 $E$ 代表一个“表达式”，它由 $T$（项）和 $E'$（后续部分）组成。","x":-980,"y":-144,"width":489,"height":91,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e0a6318008cce6d5","type":"text","text":"要做预测分析（LL(1)），编译器必须是个“预言家”。它读到一个字符，就得决定用哪条规则。\n","x":-102,"y":40,"width":424,"height":57,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"1d2f3b851a213e01","type":"text","text":"#  FOLLOW 集：我退场后，谁补位？","x":745,"y":49,"width":455,"height":51,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ae7be2974d3d5710","type":"text","text":"**定义：** 某个非终结符结束之后，紧接着出现的字符可能是谁？\n\n- **直觉练习：** 看 $P$ 的 FOLLOW。\n    \n    - 在哪里用到了 $P$？在 $F \\rightarrow P F'$。\n        \n    - 当 $P$ 讲完话，谁紧接着说？是 $F'$。\n        \n    - 所以 $P$ 的后面可能紧跟 $FIRST(F')$ 里的东西（比如 `*`）。\n        \n    - 但如果 $F'$ 是 $\\varepsilon$（空）怎么办？那 $P$ 就变成了 $F$ 的结尾。意味着 $F$ 后面能跟什么，$P$ 后面就能跟什么。\n        \n    - **你的答案：** $FOLLOW(P) = \\{ *, (, a, b, \\wedge, +, ), \\# \\}$。\n        \n    - **解析你的答案：**\n        \n        - `*` 来自 $FIRST(F')$。对。\n            \n        - `+, ), #` 来自 $FOLLOW(F)$。对。\n            \n        - `(` `a` `b` `^` 哪里来的？\n            \n        - 回看 $F' \\rightarrow * F' \\mid \\varepsilon$。\n            \n        - 实际上，$FIRST(F')$ 只有 `*` 和 $\\varepsilon$。\n            \n        - **等等！** 这里有个隐蔽的逻辑链：$FOLLOW(P)$ 包含了 $FIRST(F')$。如果 $F' \\rightarrow \\varepsilon$，则包含 $FOLLOW(F)$。\n            \n        - $FOLLOW(F)$ 取决于 $T \\rightarrow F T'$。$T'$ 的 $FIRST$ 是 $\\{(, a, b, \\wedge, \\varepsilon\\}$。\n            \n        - 所以 $P$ 后面确实可能跟着 $T'$ 开头的东西（即 $T$ 的开头）。\n            \n        - **结论：** 你的推导非常严密，考虑到了 $T'$ 产生的非空字符。✅","x":602,"y":141,"width":786,"height":539,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c4da106cdacbe1f3","type":"text","text":"情况一：","x":1414,"y":-94,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"086fa268b69710b8","type":"text","text":"情况二：","x":1414,"y":0,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9750f27fcb079e5f","type":"text","text":"情况三：","x":1414,"y":83,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6e45252e66a4bf6d","type":"text","text":"","x":1800,"y":-154,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"1a416f42167fc055","type":"text","text":"编译原理","x":-226,"y":-500,"width":124,"height":60},
		{"id":"d97919e037a82721","x":65,"y":-623,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"G=(V$_T$,V$_N$,S,P)"},
		{"id":"6caeebd72eb49fc8","x":460,"y":-820,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"V$_T$:终结符集合（i、*、+等）"},
		{"id":"8d4c4fb793b9422a","x":460,"y":-700,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"V$_N$非终结符集合（P、E、F、T等）"},
		{"id":"062e85d024c088c6","x":460,"y":-560,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"S文法的开始符号"},
		{"id":"650e58adb2e5f0ee","x":460,"y":-440,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"P产生式的集合（有限）"},
		{"id":"c416103648c3ac1a","x":794,"y":-699,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"且和终结符集合交集为空"},
		{"id":"fea6678b64630ac9","x":794,"y":-560,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"也属于非终结符（p、e、f）"},
		{"id":"d73614a62e2b2e05","x":794,"y":-460,"width":250,"height":100,"type":"text","text":"每个产生式形式为P->a，p属于非终结符集合，a属于终结符和非终结符的并集的闭包"},
		{"id":"9d8d6f46cdf60e96","x":-25,"y":-340,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"语法分析器"},
		{"id":"a1961c12d2fef9cd","x":-465,"y":-820,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"语法"},
		{"id":"f131c9f7d3bc238d","x":-895,"y":-1027,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"最左推导"},
		{"id":"ddf67e69d679d7bd","x":-895,"y":-1140,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"最右推导"},
		{"id":"5d7e468c17a433e4","x":-1320,"y":-1140,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"任何一步都是对a中的最右非终结符进行替换"},
		{"id":"b2127554ac7671b8","x":-1320,"y":-1027,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"任何一步都是对a中的最左非终结符进行替换"},
		{"id":"59386ed6e0f7b576","x":-460,"y":-2260,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"vt：终结符号"},
		{"id":"6fa2e1ab7e613e30","x":-460,"y":-2177,"width":250,"height":90,"type":"text","text":"g是一个文法，s是它的开始符号。如果s-*>a,则称a是一个句型"},
		{"id":"b4a029fc0abeb2be","x":-460,"y":-2057,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"仅含有终结符号的句型是一个句子"},
		{"id":"e025aa51c13c69ac","x":-460,"y":-1957,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"如果一个文法有vt、有vn，那么它就是句型"},
		{"id":"5c7b0743e7cf3520","x":-460,"y":-1873,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"L(G)={a|S->a,a属于VT*}"},
		{"id":"a71170fa795aa95d","x":-460,"y":-1797,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"能推导到最后，全部都是终结符集合的就是语言"},
		{"id":"68e196780233ddd6","x":-197,"y":-1873,"width":110,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"语言"},
		{"id":"3b98b2e24af370d4","x":-908,"y":-598,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"词法（识别单词）"},
		{"id":"18139c69a4102afc","x":-1367,"y":-645,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"状态转换图"},
		{"id":"b5481b46f021e10b","x":-1367,"y":-800,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"一张有限方向图"},
		{"id":"a8ac5cd885dc2c04","x":-1715,"y":-919,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"结点代表状态，用圆圈表示"},
		{"id":"91d4a412f100bd89","x":-1715,"y":-828,"width":250,"height":116,"type":"text","text":"状态之间用箭弧连结，箭弧上的标记（字符）代表射出结点状态下可能的输入字符或者字符类"},
		{"id":"2d7ef7c23c888187","x":-1702,"y":-675,"width":250,"height":90,"type":"text","text":"一张转换图只包含有限个状态，其中有一个为初态，至少要有一个终态"},
		{"id":"95e5ab2ca7d9d06a","x":-1340,"y":-360,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"有限自动机（FA）"},
		{"id":"13b7ef0e4c355ab0","x":-1702,"y":-460,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"确定状态的有穷自动机（DFA）"},
		{"id":"6d7cd8e43aad91f7","x":-2021,"y":-587,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"(S，西格玛，f，S$_0$，F)"},
		{"id":"d7762f488fcd4679","x":-2420,"y":-809,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"s：有穷状态集"},
		{"id":"1a10308158243d54","x":-2420,"y":-694,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"西格玛：输入字母表（有穷）"},
		{"id":"fc4af97b23bdc7ed","x":-2420,"y":-587,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"f：状态转换函数"},
		{"id":"96ee4b4a8298800f","x":-2420,"y":-460,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"s$_0$属于s是唯一的一个初态"},
		{"id":"93b54f3926c1b04a","x":-2420,"y":-360,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"f是s的子集：终态集（可空）"},
		{"id":"59269afbe000bbb7","x":-2316,"y":-1358,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"file","file":"007_CS自学/301-编译原理/23030301曹磊第二次作业.md"},
		{"id":"f170159afa19f49c","x":-1702,"y":-238,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"非确定有限自动机（NFA）"},
		{"id":"7deefda37ddbff3c","type":"text","text":"s：有穷状态集","x":-2420,"y":-285,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3a5a3be27183c577","type":"text","text":"西格玛：输入字母表（有穷）","x":-2420,"y":-170,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"13be487fc00cc204","type":"text","text":"f：状态转换函数","x":-2420,"y":-63,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6a5308e797ddc6ca","type":"text","text":"s$_0$属于s是非空的初态集","x":-2420,"y":64,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"44f10d45a380269c","type":"text","text":"f是s的子集：终态集（可空）","x":-2420,"y":164,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3a0f72ae7bc99489","x":-2021,"y":-63,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"(S，西格玛，f，S$_0$，F)"},
		{"id":"277f8c0989f46605","x":-2760,"y":-1580,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"1.正则表达式画状态转换图"},
		{"id":"d33ca0a3a533cfad","x":-3240,"y":-1665,"width":346,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"0->1(中间输入ab)就转化成0-(a)>2-(b)>1"},
		{"id":"397514138fada976","x":-3240,"y":-1465,"width":354,"height":85,"type":"text","text":"0->1(中间输入a*)就转化成\n0->2->1\n\t-(a)>"},
		{"id":"1ab829a271f3ea28","x":-3247,"y":-1580,"width":361,"height":82,"type":"text","text":"0->1(中间输入a|b)就转化成\n0-(a)>\n  -(b)>1"},
		{"id":"2a4310b17b205259","type":"text","text":"LL(1)","x":28,"y":-140,"width":82,"height":54},
		{"id":"c73e3611c851003e","type":"text","text":"\n#### 1. FIRST 集：这一步迈出去，脚踩在哪里？\n\n**定义：** 从某个非终结符推导出的串，第一个字符可能是什么？\n\n- **直觉练习：** 看 $P \\rightarrow (E) \\mid a \\mid b \\mid \\wedge$。\n    \n    - 如果你选 $P$，第一个字可能是 `(`，也可能是 `a`，`b`，或 `^`。\n        \n    - 所以 $FIRST(P) = \\{ (, a, b, \\wedge \\}$。✅ **你做对了。**\n        \n- **进阶练习：** 看 $E \\rightarrow T E'$。\n    \n    - $E$ 的开头完全取决于 $T$ 的开头。\n        \n    - $T \\rightarrow F T'$，所以 $T$ 取决于 $F$。\n        \n    - $F \\rightarrow P F'$，所以 $F$ 取决于 $P$。\n        \n    - 所以 $E$ 的开头其实就是 $P$ 的开头。\n        \n    - $FIRST(E) = FIRST(T) = FIRST(F) = FIRST(P) = \\{ (, a, b, \\wedge \\}$。✅ **你也做对了。**","x":-160,"y":240,"width":674,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"8396a0bce5eaa7f7","x":336,"y":-335,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"自下而上分析法"},
		{"id":"0497638778738bfe","x":334,"y":-224,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"自上而下分析法"},
		{"id":"e4a28fb153591dcf","x":669,"y":-224,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"寻找**最左匹配**的推导"},
		{"id":"d6c88690f1159afd","x":669,"y":-335,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"归约"},
		{"id":"8b5f069d212e6dbb","x":669,"y":-140,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"递归下降分析法"},
		{"id":"f5d844f60443f20b","x":518,"y":-27,"width":250,"height":76,"type":"text","text":"遇到某一个候选项匹配成功，这种匹配是暂时的，如果出错，不得不“回溯”，走另一个候选项"},
		{"id":"286afa3e2a2020e5","x":820,"y":-19,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"含有文法左递归的文法将使自上而下的分析进入无限循环"}
	],
